{"word":"ἀντιφωνέω-ῶ","uri":"antiphôneô-ô","senses":[{"word":"ἀντιφωνέω-ῶ","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">ἀντιφωνέω-ῶ,</span></span> résonner en réponse, <span class=\"ital\">d’où :</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> répondre, <span class=\"aut\">Eschl.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Eum.</span> <span class=\"refch\">303 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Ant.</span> <span class=\"refch\">271 ;</span> <span class=\"grec\">πρός τινα,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plut.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Mar.</span> <span class=\"refch\">19,</span> à\nqqn ; <span class=\"ital\">avec un acc. de chose :</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">ἀ. ἔπος,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Aj.</span> <span class=\"refch\">773,</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">etc.</span> prononcer une parole en réponse ;\n<span class=\"ital\">avec double rég. :</span> <span class=\"grec\">μή μ’ ἀντιφώνει μηδέν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Ph.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1065,</span> ne\nme réponds rien ; <span class=\"ital\">p. ext.</span> répondre par\nlettre, <span class=\"aut\">Pol.</span> <span class=\"refch\">8,\n18,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> faire résonner en\nréponse, <span class=\"aut\">Anacr.</span> <span class=\"refch\">23,\n9</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">3</span> <span class=\"ital\">p.\next.</span> répondre pour un autre, se porter caution, <span class=\"aut\">Suid.</span></div>\n<div class=\"etymor\"><span class=\"etiqetymor\">Étym.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">ἀντίφωνος</span>.</div>\n"}]}